      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denton%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "During the Civil War, Union soldiers stationed in Denton celebrated Independence Day with fireworks that set a shop ablaze.",
